---
layout: default
---
<main class="portfolio-home">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <p class="route-label">YG / PORTFOLIO / {{ site.time | date: '%Y' }}</p>
      <h1 id="home-title">
        A product and AI builder with a background in cognitive science, interested in creating thoughtful technology for deeply human contexts.
      </h1>
      <p class="home-hero__lede">
        My work moves between implementation and inquiry. Both begin with close observation—of behavior, communities, and the systems around us.
      </p>
      <div class="route-actions">
        <a class="route-button route-button--dark" href="{{ '/build/' | relative_url }}">See what I build <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="route-button" href="{{ '/understand/' | relative_url }}">See what I study <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-hero__portrait">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/prof_pic.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="Portrait of Yiran Gong">
      <div class="image-index">
        <span>PORTRAIT / 01</span>
        <span>AI × COGNITION</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="route-label">INDEX / 01</p>
      <h2 id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
      <p>Projects are structured so the problem, contribution, methods, and evidence are visible before opening the full case study.</p>
    </div>

    {% assign featured_projects = site.projects | where: 'featured', true | sort: 'importance' %}
    {% if featured_projects.size > 0 %}
      <div class="project-index">
        {% for project in featured_projects %}
          {% include project-card.liquid project=project %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="framework-message">Selected projects remain unpublished until their content and evidence are ready.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="mode-switchboard" aria-labelledby="modes-title">
    <div class="mode-switchboard__header">
      <p class="route-label">INDEX / 02</p>
      <h2 id="modes-title">Two modes. One lens.</h2>
    </div>

    <a class="mode-panel mode-panel--build" href="{{ '/build/' | relative_url }}">
      <span class="mode-panel__index">B—01</span>
      <h3>Build</h3>
      <p>Turning ideas into products, workflows, agents, and experiments.</p>
      <span class="mode-panel__link">Enter Build ↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="mode-panel mode-panel--understand" href="{{ '/understand/' | relative_url }}">
      <span class="mode-panel__index">U—01</span>
      <h3>Understand</h3>
      <p>Investigating cognition, decisions, interaction, and evaluation.</p>
      <span class="mode-panel__link">Enter Understand ↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="observe-rail" href="{{ '/field-notes/' | relative_url }}">
      <span>OBSERVE / THE SHARED LENS</span>
      <p>Paying close attention to people, places, and systems before deciding what to make or study.</p>
      <span>Field notes ↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="capability-board section-block" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="route-label">INDEX / 03</p>
      <h2 id="capabilities-title">Capabilities in context</h2>
      <p>Skills stay attached to the projects and evidence that demonstrate them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="capability-board__grid">
      <div>
        <span class="capability-board__number">01</span>
        <h3>Making</h3>
        <p>AI workflows · product operations · model evaluation · prompt design · testing · deployment · instrumentation</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="capability-board__number">02</span>
        <h3>Investigating</h3>
        <p>Human collaboration · computational modeling · reinforcement learning · Bayesian models · evaluation</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="capability-board__number">03</span>
        <h3>Connecting</h3>
        <p>Community trust · close observation · cultural systems · synthesis · communication</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% assign field_notes = site.field_notes | sort: 'importance' %}
  <section class="field-notes-preview section-block" aria-labelledby="field-notes-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--inline">
      <div>
        <p class="route-label">INDEX / 04</p>
        <h2 id="field-notes-title">Field notes</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ '/field-notes/' | relative_url }}">View the observation index ↗</a>
    </div>
    {% if field_notes.size > 0 %}
      <div class="field-note-grid">
        {% for note in field_notes limit: 3 %}
          {% include field-note-card.liquid note=note %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="framework-message">Field notes remain unpublished while their observations and evidence are being assembled.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-about" aria-labelledby="home-about-title">
    <p class="route-label">INDEX / 05</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="home-about-title">I work where technical systems meet human behavior.</h2>
      <p>The detailed biography, current academic timeline, and contact information will be finalized before publication.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="route-actions">
      <a class="route-button" href="{{ '/about/' | relative_url }}">About <span>↗</span></a>
      <a class="route-button" href="{{ '/cv/' | relative_url }}">CV <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
